Network use
-----------

Section 13 of the AGPL applies to this project and is the reason it was chosen
over the GPL.  If you modify KinematiK and make it available to users over a
network - including by hosting it as a web application - you must offer those
users access to the Corresponding Source of your modified version, at no
charge, through a network server.

The Corresponding Source of the version hosted by the original author is
available at:

    https://github.com/frederikthio/kinematik


Attribution (additional term under AGPL section 7(b))
-----------------------------------------------------

As permitted by section 7(b) of the GNU Affero General Public License, the
following additional term applies to KinematiK:

    You must preserve the author attribution "KinematiK - created by
    Frederik Thio" in the Appropriate Legal Notices displayed by any work
    containing this material, and in any modified version you convey or make
    available to users over a network.

This term requires only that existing attribution be preserved.  It grants no
additional rights to the original author and imposes no restriction on the
freedoms the AGPL gives you: you remain free to run, study, modify,
redistribute and host KinematiK, including commercially, subject to the terms
of the licence.

Under section 7, a recipient may remove this additional term from material they
convey.  The copyright notices required by sections 4 and 5 of the licence must
be retained regardless.


